    PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("She had waited until she knew her subordinate was present, partially so that she could think on what, precisely, to say, and partially to tame the Beast inside her.")%
    PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"Oh, how it had raged at.... that damn %PRINT_MALE("man", MASTER)% and %HIS_HER(MASTER)% smooth words, so confident and self-assured, even as every word %HIS_HER(MASTER)% said dripped poison into her ears.")%
